# ============================================================================
# AUREVO monorepo — .dockerignore
# Keeps the build context small and, critically, keeps secrets and local
# databases out of any image. The Dockerfiles only ever COPY specific paths,
# but this protects against accidental `COPY . .` and shrinks the context.
# ============================================================================

# VCS
.git
.gitignore

# Dependencies
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output & caches
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo

# Env & secrets — NEVER bake into an image
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Local databases (never ship the dev SQLite db)
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db.bak
**/prisma/dev.db*

# Tests & coverage
coverage
**/coverage
**/__tests__
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.e2e-spec.ts

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
